assign for class work, on the grounds that someone might possibly be offended,
challenged - and it'll have to be done eventually - but meanwhile not everyone
has the time, energy, and/or money to deal with these problems. (The person
who brought this up, however, seems more interested in attack than in the
partial solutions that've been proposed.)

